y":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其九","author":"陆游","text":"杖得轻坚馀可略，酒能醇劲更何求。\n二君最是平生旧，白首相从万事休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其四","author":"陆游","text":"客来深愧里闾情，近为衰残罢送迎。\n旋置风炉煎顾渚，剧谈犹得慰平生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其七","author":"陆游","text":"灵府不摇神泰定，病根已去脉和平。\n金丹妙处无多子，只要先生两眼明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其十","author":"陆游","text":"心明始信元无佛，气住何曾别有仙。\n领取三山安乐法，蒲团纸帐过年年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其五","author":"陆游","text":"举家食粥颜平原，坐客无毡郑广文。\n不是有心轻富贵，偶然看破是浮云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其八","author":"陆游","text":"省身要似晨通发，止杀先从暮拍蚊。\n老负明时无补报，惟将忠敬事心君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"书生习气尽驱除，酒兴诗情亦已无。\n底怪今朝亲笔砚，村乡来请辟蝗符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其三","author":"陆游","text":"断云归岫雨初收，茅舍萧条古渡头。\n短褐老人垂九十，松枯石瘦不禁秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仲秋书事十首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"秋风社散日平西，馀胙残壶手自提。\n赐食敢思烹细项，家庖仍禁擘团脐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"休日登花将军庙小楼","author":"陆游","text":"林间缥缈出层楼，栏角苍茫万顷秋。\n曾是胸中著云梦，不妨此地少迟留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先大父以元祐乙亥寓居妙明僧舍后百馀年当嘉泰癸亥游复假榻一夕感叹成咏","author":"陆游","text":"楚公仙去几秋风，巷陌萧条旧隐空。\n遗老即今无处觅，断香残照泪痕中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"共语","author":"陆游","text":"乔岳成尘巨海枯，欲求共语一人无。\n黄金已作飞烟去，痴汉终身守药炉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赋一绝","author":"陆游","text":"江风吹雨濯征尘，百尺阑干爽气新。\n不向岳阳楼上醉，定知未可作诗人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"军中杂歌八首 其七","author":"陆游","text":"渔阳儿女美如花，春风楼上学琵琶。\n如今便死知无恨，不属番家属汉家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"军中杂歌八首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"三受降城无壅城，贼来杀尽始还营。\n漠南漠北静如扫，清夜不闻胡马声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":4762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]